<title>USA: CIBER Inc Q1 shr proforma $0.14.</title>
<headline>CIBER Inc Q1 shr proforma $0.14.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo. 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter ended September 30,   1996	    1995</p>
<p> Revenues			   $49,489,000    $38,258,000</p>
<p> Income before income taxes     4,500,000	3,079,000</p>
<p> Pro forma net income	     2,603,000	1,871,000</p>
<p> EPS					    .14		.11</p>
<p> Shares				19,069,000     17,200,000</p>
<p>NOTES: Per share based on pro forma net income. Pro forma adjustments to income tax increased pro forma net income by $969,000 or $0.05 per share in 1996 and decreased pro forma net by $50,000 in 1995 to reflect the income tax expense of merged companies.</p>
</text>
